@title Review notes: right click on empty canvas adds a note at that spot
@area Schematic
# The context menu has Add review note...; the note is about the spot and shows a bubble there.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click 640 420 right
wait 6
expect "Add review note"
shot context-menu
click_text "Add review note…"
wait 8
expect "This spot"
text Room for a second contactor here
wait 4
click_text "Add as Me"
wait 8
expect "A spot on page"
shot spot-note-bubble
check_layout
